    shown for different filtration parameters. We indicate the ranks $
    \beta_i$ of the homology vector spaces in degree $i$ for each filtration value.  D): The resulting barcode of the full filtration, with dotted lines highlighting the chosen filtration values in A)-C) for homology degrees $0$ and $1$.}
