\panel{pan:clustersize_selfpropulsion}~Fraction of motile particles in clusters of more than 300 particles as a function of self-propulsion force $M$, for different axial force thresholds $\maxcomp$. Inset: the same data with the self-propulsion force rescaled by $\maxcomp$.
