    % Measure regression accuracy between predicted and ground truth continuous pedal values. 
    \item \textbf{Accuracy with Tolerance}: Evaluates the model’s precision and resolution along the continuous pedal depth axis. A prediction is considered correct if its absolute error falls within a specified threshold.
\end{itemize}
