Removing UG (\texttt{No UG}) significantly degraded performance, causing a 20.7\% drop in the valid rate and a 58.6\% reduction in LFC compared to the \texttt{Full} agent, highlighting the benefit of the structured, unit-by-unit approach for generating complex and valid code.
