& $m_0$ 
& $m_1$ 
& $m_2$ 
& $m_3$\\
\hline
$\pp$ & $1$ & $1$ & $1$ & $1$ \\
\hline
$\pmi$ & $1$  & $-1$  & $-1$ & $1$\\
\hline
$\mip$ & $1$ & $-1$ & $1$ & $-1$\\
