  \textit{Adaptation time} (reported as mean~$\pm$~SD) is the time needed to update the model on a single trial with DietCORP.  
  Only the patch-embedding layer was trainable for the Transformer; for a fair comparison, only the day-specific linear layer was trainable for the baseline GRU. 
  }
