\section{Results}
\label{section:results}

Our main goal in this section is to evaluate the relative quality of the similarity matrices extracted from QCML, as compared with those extracted from the standard Euclidean metric, and from state-of-the-art supervised similarity learning with random forests.



\subsection{Target variable prediction}
