\paragraph{Model definition} We propose modeling the multivariate distribution of the day-ahead electricity prices in increasing complexity. All models are updated online, i.e. using only the new data for each day. We differentiate between an adaptive estimation, which is updating a single, unconditional distributional parameter and the full conditional estimation linking the distribution parameter to explanatory variables. 
